---
const configured = Boolean(import.meta.env.ADMIN_USER && import.meta.env.ADMIN_PASSWORD);
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>HiDREAM Admin</title>
  </head>
  <body style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 760px; margin: 60px auto; padding: 24px;">
    <h1>HiDREAM Admin</h1>
    <p>Free Worker mode admin shell. Product management and media publishing are being migrated to the D1 + GitHub Static Assets backend.</p>
    <p>{configured ? 'Admin credentials are configured.' : 'ADMIN_USER / ADMIN_PASSWORD are not configured yet.'}</p>
  </body>
</html>
